"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">40</div><h1>기능동사 구문</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Funktionsverbgefüge: Nomen-Verb-Verbindungen</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 40의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>C1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">명사에 맞는 기능동사를 골라요 — eine Entscheidung treffen · eine Frage stellen</div><div class=\"x-goal\">전치사 + 명사형 구문을 굳은 모양 그대로 써요 — in Kraft treten · zur Verfügung stehen</div><div class=\"x-goal\">bringen ↔ kommen처럼 '하다'와 '되다'의 짝을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">구문 뒤의 전치사를 지키고, 동사 하나와 구문을 서로 바꿔 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"5eca0669e7\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Bis Freitag muss der Vorstand eine Entscheidung <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) nehmen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) treffen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) machen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) tun</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'결정을 내리다'는 eine Entscheidung treffen이에요. 명사와 동사를 한 덩어리로 외워요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8017443484\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Nach dem Vortrag konnten die Zuhörer Fragen <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) setzen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) legen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) stellen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) fragen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'질문을 하다'는 eine Frage stellen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5ba8df5185\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Die neue Regelung <span class=\"qblank\"></span> nächste Woche in Kraft.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) kommt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) steht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) tritt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) geht</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'효력이 생기다'는 in Kraft treten이에요. 전치사 + 명사 부분은 문장 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"aa6f632565\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Im Lesesaal <span class=\"qblank\"></span> den Studierenden 40 Computer zur Verfügung.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) stehen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) gehen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) stellen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) kommen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">zur Verfügung stehen은 '쓸 수 있게 되어 있다'예요. stellen은 4격 목적어가 있어야 해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"783ce6ed1c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Das Alter <span class=\"qblank\"></span> bei der Bewerbung keine Rolle.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) spielt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) nimmt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) macht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) hat</button></div><div class=\"qe\">eine Rolle spielen은 '중요하다'예요. 부정은 kein으로 해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5e5ea8fb00\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Bei dem Unfall <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mehrere Autofahrer Erste Hilfe.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) leisteten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) trafen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) stellten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) übten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'도움을 주다'는 Hilfe leisten이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"00eab2a9d8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wir müssen mehr Rücksicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> die Umwelt nehmen.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 환경을 더 생각해야 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir müssen mehr Rücksicht <b>auf</b> die Umwelt nehmen.</div>Rücksicht nehmen auf + 4격.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b47e0f0504\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;an&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Die Opposition übt deutliche Kritik <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> der Steuerreform.</div><div class=\"qko\">야당은 세제 개혁을 분명하게 비판해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Opposition übt deutliche Kritik <b>an</b> der Steuerreform.</div>Kritik üben an + 3격. 동사 kritisieren은 4격을 받지만 구문은 an을 받아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5d087cb661\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zu&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Die Firma will <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> dem Bericht keine Stellung nehmen.</div><div class=\"qko\">회사는 그 보도에 대해 입장을 밝히지 않으려고 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Firma will <b>zu</b> dem Bericht keine Stellung nehmen.</div>Stellung nehmen zu + 3격.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3324a7f3f0\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gestellt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Er hat einen Antrag auf ein Stipendium <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사 · 과거분사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 장학금을 신청했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er hat einen Antrag auf ein Stipendium <b>gestellt</b>.</div>einen Antrag stellen. 무엇을 신청하는지는 auf + 4격으로 말해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"82193260d5\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;getroffen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Wir haben alle nötigen Vorbereitungen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사 · 과거분사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">필요한 준비는 다 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir haben alle nötigen Vorbereitungen <b>getroffen</b>.</div>Vorbereitungen treffen. treffen – traf – getroffen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"88f8e22e28\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ergriffen&quot;,&quot;getroffen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Die Stadt hat neue Maßnahmen für mehr Sicherheit im Verkehr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사 · 과거분사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">시는 교통안전을 높이려고 새 조치를 취했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Stadt hat neue Maßnahmen für mehr Sicherheit im Verkehr <b>ergriffen</b>.</div>Maßnahmen ergreifen. ergreifen – ergriff – ergriffen. Maßnahmen treffen이라고도 해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"935e2db6c8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Frage&quot;,&quot;Betracht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Ein Auto für 40 000 Euro kommt für meine Eltern nicht in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">4만 유로짜리 차는 우리 부모님께 고려 대상이 아니에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ein Auto für 40 000 Euro kommt für meine Eltern nicht in <b>Frage</b>.</div>in Frage kommen은 '고려 대상이 되다'예요. 전치사 + 명사형은 nicht로 부정해요. in Betracht kommen도 같은 뜻이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"83aa5ccd4b\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Bescheid&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Geben Sie uns bitte bis Montag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span>, ob Sie kommen.</div><div class=\"qko\">오실지 월요일까지 알려 주세요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Geben Sie uns bitte bis Montag <b>Bescheid</b>, ob Sie kommen.</div>Bescheid geben · sagen은 '알려 주다'예요. 관사 없이 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8830f5415a\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Sitzung ist um fünf Uhr zu Ende gegangen&quot;,&quot;Um fünf Uhr ist die Sitzung zu Ende gegangen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">회의는 다섯 시에 끝났어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">gegangen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">zu</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">fünf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Uhr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Sitzung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Ende</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">um</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Sitzung ist um fünf Uhr zu Ende gegangen.</b></div>zu Ende gehen은 '끝나다'예요. 완료형에서는 zu Ende가 gegangen 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"637de5b5f6\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Auto steht mir heute nicht zur Verfügung&quot;,&quot;Heute steht mir das Auto nicht zur Verfügung&quot;,&quot;Mir steht das Auto heute nicht zur Verfügung&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘은 제가 그 차를 쓸 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">steht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">zur</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Verfügung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Auto</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">mir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Auto steht mir heute nicht zur Verfügung.</b></div>zur Verfügung stehen. 전치사 + 명사형은 그 앞에 nicht를 놓아 부정해요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"f84891dbd7\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Die Elternvertreterin <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die vielen Hausaufgaben zur Sprache.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) trat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) brachte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) kam</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) ging</button></div><div class=\"qe\">4격 목적어(die vielen Hausaufgaben)가 있으니 '꺼내다'의 zur Sprache bringen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3e78fca9e0\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> In der Diskussion <span class=\"qblank\"></span> auch die Kosten zur Sprache.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) kamen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) setzten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) stellten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) brachten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">목적어가 없고 die Kosten이 주어예요 → '거론되다'의 zur Sprache kommen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"14be00ddca\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> 맞는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Die beiden Firmen haben noch keine Vereinbarung getroffen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Die beiden Firmen haben noch nicht eine Vereinbarung treffen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Die beiden Firmen haben noch keine Vereinbarung gemacht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Die beiden Firmen haben noch nicht Vereinbarung getroffen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">eine Vereinbarung treffen. 4격 명사형 구문은 kein으로 부정해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"92dc2c2cba\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fasste&quot;],[&quot;Beschluss&quot;,&quot;Entschluss&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Der Stadtrat beschloss, das Schwimmbad zu sanieren.<br>→ Der Stadtrat <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사 · 과거형)</span> den <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span>, das Schwimmbad zu sanieren.</div><div class=\"qko\">시의회는 수영장을 수리하기로 결의했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Stadtrat beschloss, das Schwimmbad zu sanieren.<br>→ Der Stadtrat <b>fasste</b> den <b>Beschluss</b>, das Schwimmbad zu sanieren.</div>beschließen = einen Beschluss fassen. 과거형이라서 fasste예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"34c42f3354\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Anspruch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Viele Kunden nutzen den Lieferservice.<br>→ Viele Kunden nehmen den Lieferservice in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">많은 고객이 배달 서비스를 이용해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Viele Kunden nutzen den Lieferservice.<br>→ Viele Kunden nehmen den Lieferservice in <b>Anspruch</b>.</div>etwas nutzen = etwas in Anspruch nehmen. 4격 목적어는 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5326f46650\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ziehen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Die Forscher bezweifeln die Ergebnisse der Studie.<br>→ Die Forscher <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사 · 현재형)</span> die Ergebnisse der Studie in Zweifel.</div><div class=\"qko\">연구자들은 그 연구 결과를 의심해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Forscher bezweifeln die Ergebnisse der Studie.<br>→ Die Forscher <b>ziehen</b> die Ergebnisse der Studie in Zweifel.</div>etwas bezweifeln = etwas in Zweifel ziehen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"87f0e0dbb9\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;findet&quot;],[&quot;Anwendung&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Das neue Verfahren wird in vielen Kliniken angewendet.<br>→ Das neue Verfahren <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사)</span> in vielen Kliniken <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(명사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">새 방식은 많은 병원에서 쓰여요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das neue Verfahren wird in vielen Kliniken angewendet.<br>→ Das neue Verfahren <b>findet</b> in vielen Kliniken <b>Anwendung</b>.</div>angewendet werden = Anwendung finden. finden과 쓰는 구문은 수동과 뜻이 같아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c33a4c1b3c\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Unsere Chefin legt viel Wert auf Teamarbeit&quot;,&quot;Auf Teamarbeit legt unsere Chefin viel Wert&quot;,&quot;Viel Wert legt unsere Chefin auf Teamarbeit&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 사장님은 팀워크를 아주 중요하게 여겨요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">viel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">legt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Unsere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Chefin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Wert</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">auf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Teamarbeit</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Unsere Chefin legt viel Wert auf Teamarbeit.</b></div>Wert legen auf + 4격. 명사 Wert 앞에 viel이나 großen을 넣어 뜻을 더해요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"6b6925055f\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Die Ministerin geriet wegen des Skandals unter Druck.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Das Problem brachte in der Sitzung zur Sprache.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Ihr Vorschlag fand im Team große Beachtung.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Der alte Brauch ist in Vergessenheit geraten.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bringen은 4격 목적어가 있어야 해요. 문제가 '거론됐다'는 뜻이면 Das Problem kam in der Sitzung zur Sprache예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7df93e4748\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 'Die Warnung der Experten wurde wenig beachtet.'와 뜻이 같은 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Die Warnung der Experten fand wenig Beachtung.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Die Warnung der Experten stellte wenig Beachtung.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Die Warnung der Experten nahm wenig Beachtung.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Die Warnung der Experten brachte wenig Beachtung.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">beachtet werden = Beachtung finden. 수동의 뜻을 가진 구문이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"19f101d946\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Bezug&quot;],[&quot;Betracht&quot;,&quot;Erwägung&quot;],[&quot;Verfügung&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Sehr geehrte Frau Berger,<br>ich nehme <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(관련짓다)</span> auf Ihre E-Mail vom 12. April. Leider können wir Ihren Vorschlag nicht in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(고려하다)</span> ziehen. Für Rückfragen stehe ich Ihnen gern zur <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(쓸 수 있다)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">베르거 님께, 4월 12일에 보내신 메일과 관련해 말씀드려요. 아쉽지만 제안하신 내용은 고려할 수 없어요. 더 궁금한 점이 있으면 언제든 문의해 주세요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sehr geehrte Frau Berger,<br>ich nehme <b>Bezug</b> auf Ihre E-Mail vom 12. April. Leider können wir Ihren Vorschlag nicht in <b>Betracht</b> ziehen. Für Rückfragen stehe ich Ihnen gern zur <b>Verfügung</b>.</div>Bezug nehmen auf · in Betracht ziehen · zur Verfügung stehen. 공문에서 늘 쓰는 구문이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"2042103c41\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;übten&quot;],[&quot;harte&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Die Zeitungen kritisierten den Trainer hart.<br>→ Die Zeitungen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사 · 과거형)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(hart)</span> Kritik <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> dem Trainer.</div><div class=\"qko\">신문들은 그 감독을 심하게 비판했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Zeitungen kritisierten den Trainer hart.<br>→ Die Zeitungen <b>übten</b> <b>harte</b> Kritik <b>an</b> dem Trainer.</div>kritisieren = Kritik üben an + 3격. 부사 hart는 명사 앞에서 형용사 harte가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0dd2d2316a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;nehmen&quot;,&quot;haben&quot;],[&quot;starken&quot;,&quot;großen&quot;],[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Soziale Medien beeinflussen die Meinung der Jugendlichen stark.<br>→ Soziale Medien <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(기능동사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(stark)</span> Einfluss <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> die Meinung der Jugendlichen.</div><div class=\"qko\">소셜 미디어는 청소년의 생각에 큰 영향을 미쳐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Soziale Medien beeinflussen die Meinung der Jugendlichen stark.<br>→ Soziale Medien <b>nehmen</b> <b>starken</b> Einfluss <b>auf</b> die Meinung der Jugendlichen.</div>beeinflussen = Einfluss nehmen auf + 4격. 부사 stark는 형용사가 되고, 관사 없는 4격 남성이라서 -en이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"368b2cbe8b\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Für den kurzen Arbeitsweg nimmt sie eine hohe Miete in Kauf&quot;,&quot;Sie nimmt für den kurzen Arbeitsweg eine hohe Miete in Kauf&quot;,&quot;Sie nimmt eine hohe Miete für den kurzen Arbeitsweg in Kauf&quot;,&quot;Eine hohe Miete nimmt sie für den kurzen Arbeitsweg in Kauf&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">출근길이 짧아서 그녀는 비싼 월세를 감수해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Miete</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nimmt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Kauf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Arbeitsweg</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Für</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">kurzen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">eine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">hohe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">sie</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Für den kurzen Arbeitsweg nimmt sie eine hohe Miete in Kauf.</b></div>etwas in Kauf nehmen은 '감수하다'예요. in Kauf는 문장 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"81ffb90ad6\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie stellt einen Antrag auf ein Visum.&quot;,&quot;Sie stellt einen Visumantrag.&quot;,&quot;Sie stellt einen Visumsantrag.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 동사를 기능동사 구문으로 바꿔 쓰세요. (Antrag)</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Sie beantragt ein Visum.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie stellt einen Antrag auf ein Visum.</b></div>etwas beantragen = einen Antrag auf + 4격 stellen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"bb33e4bd86\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Er hat sich von seinen Freunden verabschiedet.&quot;,&quot;Von seinen Freunden hat er sich verabschiedet.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> 기능동사 구문을 동사 하나로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Er hat von seinen Freunden Abschied genommen.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 32\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Er hat sich von seinen Freunden verabschiedet.</b></div>Abschied nehmen von = sich verabschieden von. 시제는 현재완료 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"2f0f24189f\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Rednerin brachte ihre Sorge zum Ausdruck.&quot;,&quot;Ihre Sorge brachte die Rednerin zum Ausdruck.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> 동사를 기능동사 구문으로 바꿔 쓰세요. (Ausdruck)</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Die Rednerin drückte ihre Sorge aus.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Rednerin brachte ihre Sorge zum Ausdruck.</b></div>etwas ausdrücken = etwas zum Ausdruck bringen. 4격 목적어는 그대로 두고, zum Ausdruck는 문장 끝에 놓아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a8f22f30ee\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 곧 결정을 내려야 해요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">müssen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">bald</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">eine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Entscheidung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">machen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Wir müssen bald eine Entscheidung treffen.</b></div>Entscheidung의 짝은 treffen이에요. 뜻만 보고 machen을 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"31aa3c2568\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">버스에서는 나이 든 승객을 배려해야 해요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Bus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">sollte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">man</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Rücksicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">für</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">ältere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">Fahrgäste</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">nehmen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Im Bus sollte man Rücksicht auf ältere Fahrgäste nehmen.</b></div>Rücksicht nehmen은 auf + 4격을 받아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"22a97e7dde\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀의 가장 큰 소원이 마침내 이루어졌어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Ihr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">größter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">Wunsch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">kam</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">endlich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">Erfüllung.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Ihr größter Wunsch ging endlich in Erfüllung.</b></div>'이루어지다'는 in Erfüllung gehen이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"